Bind Npc 24427 Zone 1
Quest 405 "[Repeatable Solo] Sabertooth Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Melverick has commissioned you to hunt Sabertooth. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 10 of 653, 603 at direction_99

Requires player level >= 37 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 550000 experience or 750000 with premium

direction_99 = location "Sabertooth" about "Sabertooth\nThe representative carnivore of the Adonis Continent, entire body is shrouded by a protective armor, levels rapid attack" found "Karus" karus at 881 1296 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, how're you feeling? The imperial palace guard is looking for you..."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "How is your adventure here in the mainland? Isn't it tough? Haha- just like before, I came here to ask you for a hunt. The targets are the Saber Tooths.. They are pretty ferocious, but would you like to hunt them?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I will give you a very useful armor when you complete this hunt."

On ready
    Say "A hunt of this intensity is a piece of cake, right? Heh heh..."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Well done. The reward is the armor suppied only to the Palace Guards, so I am sure you'll find it handy."
